.email-header
  h1 Case Created Successfully!

.email-content
  p style="font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 24px;"
    | Hi #{@case.name},
  
  p style="font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 24px;"
    | Your case has been created successfully! We've received your support request and our team has been notified.

  .info-box
    h2 style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; color: #1f2937; font-size: 20px;"
      | Case ##{@case.case_number}
    
    p style="margin-bottom: 12px;"
      strong style="color: #374151;"
        | Problem:
    p style="color: #4b5563; margin-top: 8px;"
      = simple_format(@case.problem_description)

  - if @case.solutions.any?
    .info-box style="background-color: #f0fdf4; border-left-color: #10b981;"
      h3 style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #1f2937; font-size: 18px;"
        | Suggested Solutions
      p style="color: #4b5563; margin-bottom: 16px;"
        | We've found some possible solutions that might help:
      - @case.solutions.limit(3).each do |solution|
        div style="margin-bottom: 20px; padding: 12px; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 4px;"
          p style="margin: 0 0 8px 0; font-weight: 600; color: #1f2937;"
            = solution.problem_title
          p style="margin: 0; color: #4b5563; font-size: 14px;"
            = simple_format(solution.solution_text)

  .code-box
    p style="margin: 0 0 8px 0; font-size: 14px; color: #92400e; font-weight: normal;"
      | Your Access Code:
    p style="margin: 0;"
      = @case.access_code
    p style="margin: 12px 0 0 0; font-size: 12px; color: #92400e; font-weight: normal; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;"
      | Keep this code safe - you'll need it to access your case

  .text-center style="margin: 32px 0;"
    = link_to "View Your Case", @case_url, class: "button", style: "display: inline-block; padding: 14px 32px; background-color: #7c3aed; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px;"

  p style="font-size: 14px; color: #6b7280; margin-top: 24px;"
    | You can use the link above to view your case and any suggested solutions. If you find a solution that works, you can mark it as solved directly from the case page.

  p style="font-size: 14px; color: #6b7280; margin-top: 16px;"
    | Case created on #{@case.created_at.strftime("%B %d, %Y at %I:%M %p")}
